        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How terrible it will be for those who lie awake and plan evil! When morning comes, as soon as they have the chance, they do the evil they planned. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they want fields, they seize them; when they want houses, they take them. No one's family or property is safe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “I am planning to bring disaster on you, and you will not be able to escape it. You are going to find yourselves in trouble, and then you will not walk so proudly any more. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When that time comes, people will use your story as an example of disaster, and they will sing this song of despair about your experience:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So then, when the time comes for the land to be given back to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s people, there will be no share for any of you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people preach at me and say, “Don't preach at us. Don't preach about all that. God is not going to disgrace us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do you think the people of Israel are under a curse?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "under a curse",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Has the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lost his patience? Would he really do such things? Doesn't he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Doesn't he",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Don't I.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " speak kindly to those who do right?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
